<%
def url(page, params = nil)
  @base_url + "?page=" + page + (params ? "&#{params}" : "")
end

zone = @object
-%>
Hi <%= @user.login %>,

DNS zone <%= zone.name %> is enabled as a secondary zone but has no
configured primary server. Our secondary servers may still serve a previously
loaded copy, but this does not provide a source for future updates.

Please add a primary server in the zone details and allow AXFR/IXFR from the
assigned secondary server addresses. An IP address you still own remains configured
when detached from a VPS; moving it between your VPSes does not require
adding it to each zone again.

  <%= url('dns', "action=zone_show&id=#{zone.id}") %>

You can acknowledge this alert to stop further reminders about this incident:

  <%= url('monitoring', "action=ack&id=#{@event.id}") %>

Best regards,

vpsFree.cz team

(This is an automated mail from vpsAdmin, your reply will be sent to our support)
